      "created_at": "2015-03-13T11:46:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey Everyone,&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>long time lurker first time poster here, i came accross an interesting situation yesterday while playing tactics with my brother and i wanted to see what the community thought,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>He was playing as bunker and during his turn switched his active powers to have both Turret mode and Artillery mode in play thus giving bunker a HUGE tactical advantage, as a long time fan of the original game i was curious as to whether this was allowed as usually only one mode card can be in play in the standard card game, try as we might have though we could not find any reference in the rules as to bunker only having one mode card in play.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does anyone here have an answer to this question? &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks guys&nbsp;</p>",
